# One of several targets becoming illegal does not stop the rest (CR 608.2b, 601.2d): X = 4 is divided 2 and 2 between Bot2's
# Ornithopter and its Giver of Runes. In response Giver, no longer summoning sick on turn 5, gives the Ornithopter protection
# from red, so its share is not dealt, while the Giver (a 1/2) still takes its 2 and dies. Eight mana as in the other scenarios.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Shatterskull Smashing
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Giver of Runes
Ornithopter
Plains x4
Plains x12

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Giver of Runes.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
